# QA automation kit

The QA skills and MCP servers read this project's settings from **`qakit.config.yaml`** — paths,
modules, ids, locale and MCP server names (`{{project}}-api`, `{{project}}-ui`). Project knowledge the
skills load lives in `.qakit/knowledge/`. Reinstall the skills after a kit update with `npm run skills`,
and check the setup with `npm run doctor`.
